{"h":3395,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.10598596462012833,"w":0.1132293446858724,"h":0.014772256777059067,"x":0.12754170614654589,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"JEAN:","x":0.12962962886528501,"w":0.039094651540120456,"y":0.15116279059508042,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"c":1,"y":0.16569767428804161,"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.12962962936185163,"w":0.028806584676106778,"t":"TIM:"},{"w":0.039094648361206075,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"x":0.12962963047646145,"y":0.19476744173511973,"t":"JEAN:"},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"t":"TIM:","x":0.13168724232263762,"y":0.20930232546948413,"w":0.02674897193908693,"c":1},{"x":0.1275720161467522,"w":0.041152264277140305,"t":"JEAN:","h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.23691860444977131,"c":1},{"y":0.2529069766322749,"x":0.13168724232263762,"c":1,"t":"TIM:","h":0.008720930389296333,"w":0.02674897193908693},{"y":0.26598837187225199,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"JEAN:","x":0.12757201780479652,"w":0.041152261098225923},{"w":0.02674897193908693,"c":1,"t":"TIM.","y":0.28197674407413531,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.13168724232263762},{"t":"JEAN:","w":0.039094648361206075,"x":0.12962963047646145,"y":0.36773255801418947,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"y":0.38226744163969384,"w":0.030864197413126626,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.12962962975022682,"t":"TIM:","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1295732587798312,"t":"JEAN:","y":0.42577687653305918,"w":0.039207391738891595,"h":0.011818339883649331},{"c":1,"w":0.028806584676106778,"h":0.0087209298276509362,"y":0.44040697683762797,"t":"TIM:","x":0.13168724274425112},{"h":0.013338895512413407,"t":"JEAN:","x":0.12954825876595819,"y":0.45335962184933676,"c":1,"w":0.041315005620320616},{"c":1,"t":"Oh, why's that?","y":0.14958775028298921,"w":0.11728394826253255,"x":0.22016461012799302,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"h":0.015286951098762325,"t":"Because it involves carpentry - participants will be making toys out of wood, so","x":0.22010164028573106,"y":0.16149125321571511,"w":0.5906697591145833,"c":1},{"x":0.22008239521644124,"c":1,"h":0.014379403054784468,"w":0.41166295369466144,"y":0.17685105353355435,"t":"there'll be a lot of sharp chisels and other tools around."},{"w":0.33744855244954419,"y":0.19186046498924603,"h":0.013086531271782831,"t":"It makes sense to keep children away from it.","c":1,"x":0.22016461269990137},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.22222221269879469,"y":0.20639534871720588,"w":0.5617284138997396,"t":"Exactly. Now let me tell you about some of the outdoor activities. There be","c":1},{"w":0.22016461690266925,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"supervised wild swimming ...","y":0.22084805635216209,"x":0.2181069918337305,"c":1},{"y":0.23440483552807689,"w":0.22467737833658855,"t":"Wild swimming? What's that?","x":0.21791108297047448,"h":0.015455677315540095,"c":1},{"t":"t just means swimming in natural waters, rather than a swimming pool.","x":0.22214144742630823,"y":0.2484938188731487,"c":1,"h":0.01590877315040462,"w":0.52896652221679685},{"y":0.26442873986655613,"w":0.23045267740885417,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"x":0.22016460766784263,"t":"Oh OK. In a lake, for instance."},{"x":0.22214599561412068,"w":0.59685541788736973,"c":1,"t":"Yes, there's a beautiful one just outside the town, and that'll be the venue for the","h":0.015434475192192432,"y":0.27683964997618438},{"t":"swimming. There'l be lifeguards on duty, so it's suitable for all ages. And finally,","y":0.29192054543462709,"w":0.59269073486328128,"h":0.014973093399029858,"c":1,"x":0.22010729719424829},{"w":0.58244135538736974,"c":1,"t":"there'll be a walk in some nearby woods every day. The leader is an expert on","y":0.30622426330033781,"x":0.22009734300365968,"h":0.015804835006120732},{"x":0.22012322200149639,"t":"insects. He'll show some that live in the woods, and how important they are for","y":0.32114890731828516,"w":0.58857426961263026,"h":0.014186385101929488,"c":1},{"h":0.016366992316903084,"y":0.334944129772622,"x":0.21803043979700173,"t":"the environment. So there are going to be all sorts of different things to do during","w":0.60509297688802077,"c":1},{"h":0.01560147041707205,"y":0.34951769722247394,"w":0.09192741394042972,"t":"the festival.","x":0.21953854879849879,"c":1},{"t":"There certainly are.","x":0.21987164924118124,"w":0.15085336049397785,"h":0.015126695621701658,"c":1,"y":0.36491573967819702},{"t":"If you'd like to read about how the preparations for the festival are going, the","x":0.22222221188747218,"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.37926972889158472,"w":0.56790125528971358,"c":1},{"x":0.22016461322900152,"t":"festival organiser is keeping a blog. Just search online for the festival website,","y":0.39389534871254606,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.58436213175455731},{"t":"and you'll find it.","y":0.40988372081282054,"x":0.22222222056779714,"w":0.12139918009440107,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"x":0.22001764100087334,"w":0.3685726165771484,"h":0.017485142315796121,"c":1,"y":0.42176449256595561,"t":"Well, thank you very much for all the information."},{"t":"You're welcome. Goodbye.","x":0.22222222281157655,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.43895348826091807,"w":0.20370370229085288,"c":1},{"t":"Goodbye.","h":0.015059448664545005,"y":0.45322608959314392,"c":1,"x":0.22007101259548353,"w":0.08043410619099936},{"x":0.13159726200017832,"c":1,"w":0.096887779235839855,"t":"PART 2","h":0.015144619981026675,"y":0.4982416433202379},{"w":0.053497943878173831,"x":0.13168724195391721,"h":0.010174418787512463,"y":0.52761627895798791,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"t":"MARK:","x":0.12962962929641786,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1,"y":0.57122093011569131},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.52470930220067857,"t":"I'm very pleased to welcome this evening's guest speaker, Mark Logan,","x":0.22016462071188622,"w":0.53497940063476557},{"h":0.014621770002816725,"y":0.5381203327090186,"x":0.22214056246633579,"w":0.56188507080078121,"c":1,"t":"who's going to tell us about the recent transformation of Minster Park. Over"},{"h":0.016665391843366684,"x":0.22413999933671336,"c":1,"w":0.57643193562825523,"t":"Thank you. I'm sure you're all familiar with Minster Park. It's been a feature of","y":0.56581630788301052},{"x":0.2200642314083808,"y":0.58134477669611417,"t":"the city for well over a century, and has been the responsibility of the city council","w":0.60104949951171871,"c":1,"h":0.017239013465189412},{"x":0.22222221712170531,"y":0.59738372082317914,"c":1,"w":0.5884773763020833,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"for most of that time. What perhaps isn't so well known is the origin of the park:"},{"w":0.58040100097656255,"y":0.61035859793798153,"x":0.22006602172320838,"c":1,"h":0.016628594505211258,"t":"unlike many public parks that started in private ownership, as the garden of a"},{"x":0.22216082275766591,"t":"large house, for instance, Minster was some waste land, which people living","w":0.57211349487304686,"h":0.01496884454967562,"c":1,"y":0.62486171074787122},{"t":"nearby started planting with flowers in 1892. It was unclear who actually owned","h":0.014899905915816358,"y":0.63950047372324581,"c":1,"w":0.59068644205729159,"x":0.22214748720340291},{"t":"the land, and this wasn't settled until 20 years later, when the council took","w":0.55362208048502604,"y":0.65392030762224418,"c":1,"h":0.017256266657960651,"x":0.22010536138511477},{"x":0.21964561425500012,"c":1,"w":0.12633229573567711,"t":"possession of it.","y":0.66837670188191889,"h":0.016529204567413913},{"x":0.22222222462649466,"y":0.694640753577216,"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.53909464518229167,"c":1,"t":"You may have noticed the statue near one of the entrances. It's of Diane"},{"c":1,"t":"Gosforth, who played a key role in the history of the park. Once the council","w":0.55781509399414064,"x":0.22213577390717223,"h":0.016848980889022758,"y":0.70780011802475618},{"y":0.72191017707605354,"t":"had become the legal owner, it planned to sell the land for housing. Many local","w":0.58870402018229173,"h":0.017602951984382997,"c":1,"x":0.2221124040583832},{"t":"people wanted it to remain a place that everyone could go to, to enjoy the fresh","x":0.22213118299657775,"h":0.016644933900507364,"w":0.59071818033854162,"y":0.73666779262729776,"c":1},{"y":0.75145348824656288,"c":1,"x":0.22427982704432434,"w":0.55555557250976562,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"air and natural environment - remember the park is in a densely populated"},{"c":1,"w":0.57613169352213545,"h":0.01472320376914027,"y":0.76590106020848736,"x":0.22016460594037918,"t":"residential area. Diane Gosforth was one of those people, and she organised"},{"w":0.60517964680989578,"y":0.77949678672559786,"t":"petitions and demonstrations, which eventually made the council change its mind","x":0.22209776287398542,"c":1,"h":0.01727902847128282},{"y":0.79651162779295337,"x":0.22427983330462459,"t":"about the future of the land.","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.20781893412272134},{"c":1,"t":"Soon after this the First World War broke out, in 1914, and most of the park was","x":0.22215247916684575,"w":0.59686701456705726,"h":0.017619608147826704,"y":0.8195895432991892},{"t":"dug up and planted with vegetables, which were sold locally. At one stage the","y":0.83568904594639082,"x":0.22222222715670228,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.57818929036458333,"c":1},{"x":0.22214238571515277,"h":0.016725979368032329,"c":1,"y":0.84872665162234118,"t":"army considered taking it over for troop exercises and got as far as contacting","w":0.58245742797851563},{"c":1,"x":0.22213838838463082,"y":0.86279614491710821,"w":0.57836903889973956,"t":"the city council, then decided the park was too small to be of use. There were","h":0.017087038891616002},{"h":0.016745258416668962,"w":0.57219462076822913,"y":0.87786159544691322,"t":"occasional public meetings during the war, in an area that had been retained","c":1,"x":0.2221409533295152},{"x":0.22426339036188495,"y":0.89674392331244934,"c":1,"w":0.072049350738525392,"h":0.010291223110383219,"t":"as grass."},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.13374485635477074,"t":"102","w":0.03497942288716635,"c":1,"y":0.92441860451247082},{"x":0.86213991722833039,"w":0.026748971939086985,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"Q7","y":0.16133720914938376},{"x":0.86213991722833039,"y":0.26308139519589546,"w":0.026748971939086985,"t":"Q8","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"Q9","y":0.31976744161209747,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.8621399173432136,"w":0.026748971939086985},{"c":1,"x":0.8580246919615695,"t":"Q10","h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.39244186032428685,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"t":"Q11","y":0.60838010289266797,"x":0.85880051220725018,"w":0.037391220728556385,"h":0.014618464718156976,"c":1},{"y":0.72238372079154045,"c":1,"t":"Q12","h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.8600823049144416,"w":0.034979422887166378},{"y":0.83430232544056593,"c":1,"t":"Q13","x":0.86213991807673573,"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.011627907185728592}],"w":2400}